msgstr "Nastolatek: od ilu lat"

#: src/features/catalog/pages/ticket-holders-page.tsx
msgid "A ticket holder is a child, a teen or an adult by their age on the first day of the edition. A child enters with a guardian present, a teen with a guardian’s written consent brought on paper."
